## Working agreements

- Follow the design decisions in docs/bootstrap-decisions.md; report contradictions with the PRD/SDD.
- Preserve existing user changes. Keep changes within the requested scope.
- Prefer the selected stack templates. Record requirement-backed exceptions in .bootstrap/project.json.
- Do not hand-edit bootstrap-owned regions without reconciling their manifest and source templates.
- Add meaningful behavior tests for new behavior; do not replace failing checks with placeholders.
- Keep credentials and machine-local state out of source control.

